            {
                "entry_id": "1c0ae778-04df-3350-b65e-df56877e2a9c",
                "word": "archangélique",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "9db8da76-c84f-4e33-956d-f921cacb3138",
                        "entry_id": "1c0ae778-04df-3350-b65e-df56877e2a9c",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "archangéliques"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f6113f26-13f6-3d75-b7b1-f4c4897d0809",
                        "entry_id": "1c0ae778-04df-3350-b65e-df56877e2a9c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui est propre à l’archange."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a649cc78-e3e6-490a-9f38-c6f9c867b534",
                                "sense_id": "f6113f26-13f6-3d75-b7b1-f4c4897d0809",
                                "text": "Donc, ô toi ! présent dans tout ce chaos\n Qui fait mon bonheur trouble et mélancolique,\n Toi dont je cherche en vain la face archangélique,\n Prise dans les reflets, les ombres, les eaux."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2f83a3a8-cf02-3c2c-b7f9-da0c000ff868",
                        "entry_id": "1c0ae778-04df-3350-b65e-df56877e2a9c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Par analogie : qui a une très grande douceur ou perfection morale."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8817d8a3-40be-45a9-a064-270db6eee46c",
                                "sense_id": "2f83a3a8-cf02-3c2c-b7f9-da0c000ff868",
                                "text": "Une beauté archangélique."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "76a369c6-30a8-41ad-8882-ccc934280d07",
                                "sense_id": "2f83a3a8-cf02-3c2c-b7f9-da0c000ff868",
                                "text": "Une âme archangélique."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5f8a5456-05a9-4418-abc4-4695ec2a122b",
                                "sense_id": "2f83a3a8-cf02-3c2c-b7f9-da0c000ff868",
                                "text": "La merveilleuse m’écoutait avec une patience archangélique."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c4adb9c9-be62-46f9-b8cb-4c47a4e9c687",
                        "source_entry_id": "1c0ae778-04df-3350-b65e-df56877e2a9c",
                        "target_lang_word": "archangelic",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "archangelic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ca9da8f6-b746-368b-90ef-15877a8b6ff5",
                                        "entry_id": "3c2bf948-ea99-316f-aa5e-730ed54f2589",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of, relating to, resembling, or characteristic of archangels."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8712bda9-3c52-49c6-be7c-9d71420131e8",
                                                "sense_id": "ca9da8f6-b746-368b-90ef-15877a8b6ff5",
                                                "text": "[…] th’ Archangelic Power prepar’d\nFor swift descent, with him the Cohort bright\nOf watchful Cherubim;"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4edb79fd-2a0f-4596-b827-6ac510c675c9",
                                                "sense_id": "ca9da8f6-b746-368b-90ef-15877a8b6ff5",
                                                "text": "[…] the bird of heaven, with archangelic shrieks, and his imperial beak thrust upward, and his whole captive form folded in the flag of Ahab, went down with his ship […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ca9f987-282d-400a-9e9e-17690a7379a8",
                                                "sense_id": "ca9da8f6-b746-368b-90ef-15877a8b6ff5",
                                                "text": "Perhaps that steep of light is the dwelling-place of angels cherubic, seraphic, archangelic."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "98ee6494-1cec-4ef9-87c4-68be0749165a",
                                                "sense_id": "ca9da8f6-b746-368b-90ef-15877a8b6ff5",
                                                "text": "When all the voices were in full chorus, and all the batons in full wave, and all the orchestra in full triumph, and a hundred anvils under mighty hammers were in full clang, and all the towers of the city rolled in their majestic sweetness, and the whole building quaked with the boom of thirty cannon, Parepa Rosa, with a voice that will never again be equalled on earth until the archangelic voice proclaims that time shall be no longer, rose above all other sounds in her rendering of our national air, the \"Star Spangled Banner.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4de7f80e-da40-4ab3-a01b-982965c6d9f1",
                                                "sense_id": "ca9da8f6-b746-368b-90ef-15877a8b6ff5",
                                                "text": "But this is as the furious cruelty of Pharaoh made place for the benign virtue of his daughter; as the butchering sentence of Herod raised without doubt many a mother's love into heroic sublimity; as plague, as famine, as fire, as flood, as every curse and every scourge that is wielded by an angry Providence for the chastisement of man, is an appointed instrument for tempering human souls in the seven-times heated furnace of affliction, up to the standard of angelic and archangelic virtue."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1fdebee2-6cc2-4bba-b813-07154044bf9a",
                        "source_entry_id": "1c0ae778-04df-3350-b65e-df56877e2a9c",
